      "description": "Responsive field with source focus, invalid, and disabled states; set data-theme=\"dark\" for dark overrides.",
      "html": "<input class=\"ds-input\" aria-label=\"Filter measurements\" placeholder=\"Filter measurements\">",
      "css": ".ds-input{font-family:var(--font-sans, \"Inter\", \"Hiragino Sans\", \"Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN\", \"Yu Gothic UI\", \"Yu Gothic\", \"Meiryo\", \"Noto Sans JP\", \"Noto Sans CJK JP\", ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif);height:36px;width:100%;min-width:0;border:1px solid var(--input, oklch(0.9 0 0));border-radius:var(--radius-md, 8px);background:transparent;color:var(--foreground, oklch(0.145 0 0));padding:4px 12px;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px 0 rgb(0 0 0 / 0.05);transition:color 150ms,box-shadow 150ms;}.ds-input::placeholder{color:var(--muted-foreground, oklch(0.5 0 0));}.ds-input::selection{background:var(--primary, oklch(0.580 0.228 1));color:var(--primary-foreground, oklch(0.98 0 0));}.ds-input:focus-visible{outline:none;border-color:var(--ring, oklch(0.580 0.228 1));box-shadow:0 0 0 3px color-mix(in oklab, var(--ring, oklch(0.580 0.228 1)) 50%, transparent);}.ds-input[aria-invalid=\"true\"]{border-color:var(--destructive, oklch(0.567 0.245 27.325));box-shadow:0 0 0 3px color-mix(in oklab, var(--destructive, oklch(0.567 0.245 27.325)) 20%, transparent);}.ds-input:disabled{pointer-events:none;cursor:not-allowed;opacity:0.5;}.ds-input[data-theme=\"dark\"]{background:color-mix(in oklab, var(--input, oklch(0.9 0 0)) 30%, transparent);}.ds-input[data-theme=\"dark\"][aria-invalid=\"true\"]{box-shadow:0 0 0 3px color-mix(in oklab, var(--destructive, oklch(0.567 0.245 27.325)) 40%, transparent);}@media(min-width:768px){.ds-input{font-size:14px;line-height:20px;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Success Badge",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "badge-success",
      "description": "Non-interactive status label; linked badges alone have hover behavior.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-badge\">Active</span>",
      "css": ".ds-badge{font-family:var(--font-sans, \"Inter\", \"Hiragino Sans\", \"Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN\", \"Yu Gothic UI\", \"Yu Gothic\", \"Meiryo\", \"Noto Sans JP\", \"Noto Sans CJK JP\", ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:4px;width:fit-content;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:9999px;padding:2px 8px;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;font-weight:500;background:var(--success, oklch(0.53 0.14 150));color:var(--success-foreground, oklch(0.98 0 0));transition:color 150ms,box-shadow 150ms;}a.ds-badge:hover{background:color-mix(in oklab, var(--success, oklch(0.53 0.14 150)) 90%, transparent);}.ds-badge:focus-visible{outline:none;border-color:var(--ring, oklch(0.580 0.228 1));box-shadow:0 0 0 3px color-mix(in oklab, var(--ring, oklch(0.580 0.228 1)) 50%, transparent);}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Card",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "card",
      "description": "Default Card with a separately inset content slot, not the zero-padding table override.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-card\"><div class=\"ds-card-content\">Measurement summary</div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-card{font-family:var(--font-sans, \"Inter\", \"Hiragino Sans\", \"Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN\", \"Yu Gothic UI\", \"Yu Gothic\", \"Meiryo\", \"Noto Sans JP\", \"Noto Sans CJK JP\", ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif);display:flex;min-width:0;flex-direction:column;gap:24px;border:1px solid var(--border, oklch(0.9 0 0));border-radius:var(--radius-xl, 14px);padding:24px 0;background:var(--card, oklch(1 0 0));color:var(--card-foreground, oklch(0.145 0 0));box-shadow:0 1px 3px 0 rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1),0 1px 2px -1px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.1);font-size:16px;line-height:24px;}.ds-card-content{padding:0 24px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sidebar Navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "sidebar-nav-active",
      "description": "Active and inactive links; native focus outline, no invented custom focus ring.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Main\"><a class=\"ds-nav-link\" href=\"#\" aria-current=\"page\">Measurements</a><a class=\"ds-nav-link\" href=\"#\">Projects</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{font-family:var(--font-sans, \"Inter\", \"Hiragino Sans\", \"Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN\", \"Yu Gothic UI\", \"Yu Gothic\", \"Meiryo\", \"Noto Sans JP\", \"Noto Sans CJK JP\", ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;padding:8px;background:var(--sidebar, oklch(0.985 0 0));}.ds-nav-link{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;border-radius:var(--radius-md, 8px);padding:8px 12px;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;font-weight:500;text-decoration:none;color:color-mix(in oklab, var(--sidebar-foreground, oklch(0.145 0 0)) 80%, transparent);transition:color 150ms,background-color 150ms;}.ds-nav-link:hover,.ds-nav-link[aria-current=\"page\"]{background:var(--sidebar-accent, oklch(0.94 0.03 1));color:var(--sidebar-accent-foreground, oklch(0.519 0.201 9));}.ds-nav-link:focus-visible{outline:auto;}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Measurement Ledger",
    "overview": "The Measurement Ledger describes the incumbent kankaku-hub dashboard, not a new product brand. Its mood is discreet, precise, and legible: measurements and their reporting context lead, while pink provides a recognizable signal on neutral ground.\n\nSoft and precise components sit in discreet functional layers. Borders and tonal separation carry everyday hierarchy; stronger overlay shadows distinguish temporary surfaces. Compact tables coexist with more open summary and catalog cards without forcing one density onto every surface.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Discreet, precise, legible.",
      "Pink signal on neutral ground in light and dark themes.",
      "Soft and precise controls; discreet functional layers."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Semantic Pair Rule",
        "body": "Use semantic foreground/background pairs from the active theme; chart identity and measurement status are separate meanings.",
        "section": "colors"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do preserve paired light/dark semantic foregrounds, status meanings, and visible keyboard focus.",
      "Do keep measurement columns tabular and preserve the existing compact table spacing.",
      "Do preserve localized wrapping and Japanese paragraph breathing room."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't substitute chart-series colors for status semantics.",
      "Don't restore default card padding to tables that intentionally override it.",
      "Don't describe missing or uncertain measurements as confirmed zero."
    ]
  }
}
